+	 *
+	 * DMA_BUF_SYNC_READ:
+	 *     Indicates that the mapped DMA buffer will be read by the
+	 *     client via the CPU map.
+	 *
+	 * DMA_BUF_SYNC_WRITE:
+	 *     Indicates that the mapped DMA buffer will be written by the
+	 *     client via the CPU map.
+	 *
+	 * DMA_BUF_SYNC_RW:
+	 *     An alias for DMA_BUF_SYNC_READ | DMA_BUF_SYNC_WRITE.
+	 */
